@startuml
title Accept a consumer policy against pinned CI evidence
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
rectangle "Authenticated full CI cohort\nproject + pipeline + revision + jobs" as ci
artifact "Private original artifacts\ncompile ZIP, plans, actuals, XML\nAPI reports, measured history" as artifacts
component "Offline cohort validation\nSHA-256, native ownership\ncomplete disjoint shards" as validate
artifact "Accepted baseline + compiled tree\nC3 retention seal + report" as baseline
artifact "Service-owned policy\nprofiles, guards, modules, contracts" as policy
component "Actual ShardPilot core\nall tracked paths + changed tests\nfull / smoke / fallback / overflow" as core
artifact "Private JSON / HTML / TSV\ninput and runtime hashes" as evidence
rectangle "Later: published candidate\nservice migration + native C2/C3\nBenchmark deferred" as later
ci --> artifacts
artifacts --> validate
validate --> baseline
baseline --> core
policy --> core
core --> evidence
evidence --> later
note bottom of validate
Never execute consumer bytecode.
XML multiplicity differs from
GitLab display-name deduplication.
end note
@enduml
